# U/integrations/vllm/integer_model/README.md lines 61-67 and 124-135: load the model folder, then
# per prompt one prefill call and one call per further reply token, each the greedy choice. No end
# token stops the loop (RFC-0018 ignore_eos). One process, so the GPU and the 238 GB of pinned host
